{"id":"624754","name":"面条菜蛋饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624754/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面条菜","amount":"小许"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打碗里，放食盐。","img":"images/624754/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放面粉。","img":"images/624754/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌至没有干面。","img":"images/624754/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放清水搅拌至无颗粒的面糊。","img":"images/624754/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌菜焯水后的食材。","img":"images/624754/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取一些切末。","img":"images/624754/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放面糊里。","img":"images/624754/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/624754/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅刷油。","img":"images/624754/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入面糊抹平。","img":"images/624754/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面糊全部变色翻面。","img":"images/624754/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再翻面。","img":"images/624754/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放案板上。","img":"images/624754/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切块摆盘。","img":"images/624754/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624754/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}